usage: study-ui-trace-exports.py [-h] --request REQUEST [--output OUTPUT]
                                 [--output-budget-bytes OUTPUT_BUDGET_BYTES]
                                 [--free-reserve-bytes FREE_RESERVE_BYTES]
                                 [--child-seconds CHILD_SECONDS]
                                 [--total-seconds TOTAL_SECONDS]
                                 {plan,export}

Export observed tables from an already stopped original v40 trace. This module
never records, launches an app, changes a Simulator, decodes a metric or
produces performance acceptance. It preserves actual raw exports for a later,
separately qualified row/timebase/PID/coverage interpretation.

positional arguments:
  {plan,export}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --request REQUEST
  --output OUTPUT
  --output-budget-bytes OUTPUT_BUDGET_BYTES
  --free-reserve-bytes FREE_RESERVE_BYTES
  --child-seconds CHILD_SECONDS
  --total-seconds TOTAL_SECONDS
